{%- comment -%}
  UBC Dawn Ecommerce v22 — Three Generations & The UBC Crew (#family + /pages/our-story)
  Authentic UBC Photography & Playable Instagram Reel Previews:
    - 1st Gen: Manny (Founder, 47.5+ yrs, Soul of UBC, personally leads the Repair Workshop)
    - 2nd Gen: Carlos (Son, General Manager — purchasing, 20,000+ SKU inventory & daily operations)
    - 3rd Gen (Grandsons): Ashton (Lead MTB & Road Mechanic) & Alec (Lead Sales Specialist)
    - Extended UBC Crew & Loyal Riders: Lucy at UBC Alafia Park (@ubcbike.alafia), veteran & newer shop teammates, and multi-decade customers.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign is_page = section.settings.is_standalone_page
  assign story_url = '/pages/our-story'
  if pages['our-story'] != blank
    assign story_url = pages['our-story'].url
